# Normalize text files to LF in the working tree, on every machine.
#
# Why this file exists: `stylua.toml` pins `line_endings = "Unix"`, so a CRLF working copy makes
# `stylua --check src/` fail. On Windows, git's `core.autocrlf=true` default would convert LF to
# CRLF on checkout, silently breaking that quality gate on a fresh clone.
#
# Verified 2026-09-29: a CRLF .luau file makes `stylua --check src/` exit 1. With `eol=lf` the
# working tree stays LF and the gate holds.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Roblox place/model files are binary-ish XML — never mangle them.
*.rbxl binary
*.rbxlx binary
*.rbxm binary
*.rbxmx binary
